maps/campaign/Fort_Vindolanda/
maps/campaign/S1_Blood_and_Omens/
maps/campaign/S2_Chieftains_Price/
maps/campaign/S3_Through_the_Dark_Forest/
maps/campaign/S5_The_Wrath_of_Mars/
